 ### 8.1 Review processing state machine
 
-```text
-pending
-  ├─ terminal/evidence available + lease acquired → running
-  ├─ missing terminal/evidence → pending with wake
-  └─ superseded generation → pending for current generation/reconciliation
-
-running
-  ├─ valid complete packet + accepted result → reviewed
-  ├─ unavailable/invalid judge → pending with error and retry disposition
-  ├─ lease lost or generation changed → pending
-  └─ process death → watchdog returns it to pending
